<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-MAJOLI BEATS DRAGOMIR IN HAMBURG FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MAJOLI BEATS DRAGOMIR IN HAMBURG FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the $450,000 Hamburg women's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding): 4-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat 7-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
